    {
      "id": "ac.leak.t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 2194,
      "width": 422,
      "height": 390,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9f1239",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g.ac.leak"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1880379893,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 126507254,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE LEAK BUDGET — public on purpose vs never visible\nPUBLIC: who took part, on which\n  side, at which tick, when;\neach tick's total AFTER the print\n  (so a member alone at a tick\nis revealed by that total —\n  true of any published depth);\nr*, matched volume, the marginal\n  fill ratio; the price and\nfactor used at lock; a loan's\n  status and deadline; the wrap\namount (wrapping starts from a public balance).\nPRIVATE, never in plaintext anywhere — not on chain,\n  not in\nlogs, not in the bots' output,\n  not in the browser's traffic:\nbid sizes, loan sizes, collateral\n  amounts, balances, openings,\nthe auditor's and members' secret keys.\nEnforced by tests: privacy/idl_surface (no instruction\n  takes\na size), privacy/leak_audit (scans\n  everything for plaintext),\nand a redaction type in the bots (Secret<u64>).",
      "originalText": "THE LEAK BUDGET — public on purpose vs never visible\nPUBLIC: who took part, on which\n  side, at which tick, when;\neach tick's total AFTER the print\n  (so a member alone at a tick\nis revealed by that total —\n  true of any published depth);\nr*, matched volume, the marginal\n  fill ratio; the price and\nfactor used at lock; a loan's\n  status and deadline; the wrap\namount (wrapping starts from a public balance).\nPRIVATE, never in plaintext anywhere — not on chain,\n  not in\nlogs, not in the bots' output,\n  not in the browser's traffic:\nbid sizes, loan sizes, collateral\n  amounts, balances, openings,\nthe auditor's and members' secret keys.\nEnforced by tests: privacy/idl_surface (no instruction\n  takes\na size), privacy/leak_audit (scans\n  everything for plaintext),\nand a redaction type in the bots (Secret<u64>).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ac.leak",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
