      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE TWO LIFECYCLES — a round · a loan · each arrow = the instruction and who signs it",
      "originalText": "THE TWO LIFECYCLES — a round · a loan · each arrow = the instruction and who signs it",
