      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CLOSED\nclose_epoch · keeper (anyone,\n  after the grace period)\nThe 74 totals are frozen. Off\n  chain, the administrator\ndecrypts each, computes r*, and\n  builds one proof per total.",
      "originalText": "CLOSED\nclose_epoch · keeper (anyone,\n  after the grace period)\nThe 74 totals are frozen. Off\n  chain, the administrator\ndecrypts each, computes r*, and\n  builds one proof per total.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lc.e.closed",
      "autoResize": true,
