      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PRINTED — this round's xONIA\nfinalize_print: every non-empty\n  tick has a verified proof,\nand the program's own recomputation of r* matches\n  the claim.\nThe Print account stores r*,\n  matched volume and the\nmarginal fill ratio; the round is marked printed.\nNext: post_match creates the\n  loans; bid rent is refunded.",
      "originalText": "PRINTED — this round's xONIA\nfinalize_print: every non-empty\n  tick has a verified proof,\nand the program's own recomputation of r* matches\n  the claim.\nThe Print account stores r*,\n  matched volume and the\nmarginal fill ratio; the round is marked printed.\nNext: post_match creates the\n  loans; bid rent is refunded.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lc.e.printed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
