      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 16677356,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Token-2022 — Solana's token standard with extensions\nMock stock mints carry the split\n  multiplier and an issuer\nclawback (like real xStocks). Their confidential twins\n(cSTOCK-W) carry hidden balances\n  under the desk's auditor.\nCalled by window_wrap to move,\n  mint and burn tokens and to\ndeposit into a hidden balance.\n  Its confidential Transfer is\nwhat borrowers use to move collateral into escrow.",
      "originalText": "Token-2022 — Solana's token standard with extensions\nMock stock mints carry the split\n  multiplier and an issuer\nclawback (like real xStocks). Their confidential twins\n(cSTOCK-W) carry hidden balances\n  under the desk's auditor.\nCalled by window_wrap to move,\n  mint and burn tokens and to\ndeposit into a hidden balance.\n  Its confidential Transfer is\nwhat borrowers use to move collateral into escrow.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p.x.token22",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
