      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pyth receiver — the price,\n  straight from Pyth (source 4)\nPyth's own program verifies a\n  signed price message and stores\nit in an account. A listing set\n  to source 4 makes lock and\nseize read THAT account: the\n  program checks it is owned by\nthe receiver, carries the right\n  feed, is fully verified and\nfresh. The keeper is out of the price path entirely.\nDeployed; the devnet listing\n  flips to it once a Pyth key\nexists (the poster needs one).\n  programs/window_credit/quote.rs",
      "originalText": "Pyth receiver — the price,\n  straight from Pyth (source 4)\nPyth's own program verifies a\n  signed price message and stores\nit in an account. A listing set\n  to source 4 makes lock and\nseize read THAT account: the\n  program checks it is owned by\nthe receiver, carries the right\n  feed, is fully verified and\nfresh. The keeper is out of the price path entirely.\nDeployed; the devnet listing\n  flips to it once a Pyth key\nexists (the poster needs one).\n  programs/window_credit/quote.rs",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p.x.pyth",
      "autoResize": true,
