      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "window_wrap — plain shares in,\n  confidential shares out\nTakes the member's mock stock\n  into a program-owned vault and\nmints the confidential twin 1:1\n  into their hidden balance.\nRule the tests enforce: twins in\n  circulation == shares in\nthe vault, always. One vault per listed stock.\nprograms/window_wrap/src/",
      "originalText": "window_wrap — plain shares in,\n  confidential shares out\nTakes the member's mock stock\n  into a program-owned vault and\nmints the confidential twin 1:1\n  into their hidden balance.\nRule the tests enforce: twins in\n  circulation == shares in\nthe vault, always. One vault per listed stock.\nprograms/window_wrap/src/",
