      "text": "INSTRUCTIONS\ninitialize · admin · checks the\n  twin mint is confidential\n  with the desk's auditor and\n    the stock mint carries the\n  split multiplier\nwrap(amount) · member · move\n  shares to the vault, mint the\n  twin, deposit it into the member's hidden balance\nunwrap(amount) · member · burn\n  the twin, return the shares",
      "originalText": "INSTRUCTIONS\ninitialize · admin · checks the\n  twin mint is confidential\n  with the desk's auditor and\n    the stock mint carries the\n  split multiplier\nwrap(amount) · member · move\n  shares to the vault, mint the\n  twin, deposit it into the member's hidden balance\nunwrap(amount) · member · burn\n  the twin, return the shares",
