      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "window_auction — the clock\n  and the sealed order book\nRuns the rounds and takes the\n  bids. A bid's side and tick are\npublic; its size is a ciphertext\n  the program ADDS into the\nround's running total for that\n  tick, without decrypting.\nA round goes Open → Closed → Printed (or No trade).\nprograms/window_auction/src/",
      "originalText": "window_auction — the clock\n  and the sealed order book\nRuns the rounds and takes the\n  bids. A bid's side and tick are\npublic; its size is a ciphertext\n  the program ADDS into the\nround's running total for that\n  tick, without decrypting.\nA round goes Open → Closed → Printed (or No trade).\nprograms/window_auction/src/",
