      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "INSTRUCTIONS\ninitialize · admin\nopen_epoch · keeper · one round at a time\nclose_epoch · keeper, or\n  ANYONE after the grace period\nsubmit_bid(side, tick) · member · PROOF-CARRYING:\n  a validity proof (inline) under the member's and the\n  round's auditor key, a range proof (context account)\n  that the size is sane; then\n    the ciphertext is added into\n  the tick's total and the Bid account is created\nmark_printed · only the oracle program, via CPI\nclose_bid · anyone, once the\n  round is settled (refunds rent)\nrotate_auditor · admin · only between rounds",
      "originalText": "INSTRUCTIONS\ninitialize · admin\nopen_epoch · keeper · one round at a time\nclose_epoch · keeper, or\n  ANYONE after the grace period\nsubmit_bid(side, tick) · member · PROOF-CARRYING:\n  a validity proof (inline) under the member's and the\n  round's auditor key, a range proof (context account)\n  that the size is sane; then\n    the ciphertext is added into\n  the tick's total and the Bid account is created\nmark_printed · only the oracle program, via CPI\nclose_bid · anyone, once the\n  round is settled (refunds rent)\nrotate_auditor · admin · only between rounds",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p.auc.ix",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
