      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "window_credit — the loans, and\n  the proof they are safe\nCreates a loan per matched pair\n  and walks it through lock →\ndeposit → funded → repaid or\n  defaulted. The heart is ONE\nstatement the borrower proves\n  without revealing anything:\nE_Δ = (price × factor) × hidden\n  collateral − haircut × hidden\nloan ≥ 0. The program forms E_Δ itself from the two\nciphertexts and the public price, so the proof cannot\n  lie.\nReads: the oracle's Print, the\n  auction's Bid, the registry's\nMember, the price account, the mint's split factor.\nprograms/window_credit/src/",
      "originalText": "window_credit — the loans, and\n  the proof they are safe\nCreates a loan per matched pair\n  and walks it through lock →\ndeposit → funded → repaid or\n  defaulted. The heart is ONE\nstatement the borrower proves\n  without revealing anything:\nE_Δ = (price × factor) × hidden\n  collateral − haircut × hidden\nloan ≥ 0. The program forms E_Δ itself from the two\nciphertexts and the public price, so the proof cannot\n  lie.\nReads: the oracle's Print, the\n  auction's Bid, the registry's\nMember, the price account, the mint's split factor.\nprograms/window_credit/src/",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p.cr.h",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
