      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STORES — Loan[\"loan\", round, borrower, tick, k]\nLender, borrower, the round and\n  rate, status, the fill ratio,\nthe encrypted loan size, the encrypted collateral, the\ncommitment to E_Δ, a sealed\n  note for partial fills, the\nprice and factor used at lock,\n  the deadline, the listing.\nStatus: Pending → Requested →\n  Deposited → Locked → Active →\nRepaid | Defaulted (then \"collateral released\").",
      "originalText": "STORES — Loan[\"loan\", round, borrower, tick, k]\nLender, borrower, the round and\n  rate, status, the fill ratio,\nthe encrypted loan size, the encrypted collateral, the\ncommitment to E_Δ, a sealed\n  note for partial fills, the\nprice and factor used at lock,\n  the deadline, the listing.\nStatus: Pending → Requested →\n  Deposited → Locked → Active →\nRepaid | Defaulted (then \"collateral released\").",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p.cr.loan",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
