      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE COLLATERAL SCHEDULE —\n  several stocks, one rate\nEach eligible collateral is a\n  Listing with its own price\nsource, haircut and freshness\n  limits. Which stock a borrower\npledges changes nothing about the\n  auction, the proofs or the\nrate — only which price and haircut go into E_Δ.\ndocs/LISTINGS.md",
      "originalText": "THE COLLATERAL SCHEDULE —\n  several stocks, one rate\nEach eligible collateral is a\n  Listing with its own price\nsource, haircut and freshness\n  limits. Which stock a borrower\npledges changes nothing about the\n  auction, the proofs or the\nrate — only which price and haircut go into E_Δ.\ndocs/LISTINGS.md",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
