      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STORES — PriceCache[\"price\", feed id]\nThe keeper's copy of a price: value, the source's OWN\ntimestamp (kept unmodified, so\n  its age is public), and the\nslot it was posted.\nTwo freshness rules, checked at lock AND at seize:\n① the keeper posted recently\n  enough (the keeper is alive)\n② the quote itself is recent\n  enough (the source is alive)\nEither fails → nothing happens.\n  Inaction, never a wrong action.",
      "originalText": "STORES — PriceCache[\"price\", feed id]\nThe keeper's copy of a price: value, the source's OWN\ntimestamp (kept unmodified, so\n  its age is public), and the\nslot it was posted.\nTwo freshness rules, checked at lock AND at seize:\n① the keeper posted recently\n  enough (the keeper is alive)\n② the quote itself is recent\n  enough (the source is alive)\nEither fails → nothing happens.\n  Inaction, never a wrong action.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p.cr.cache",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
