      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADDING BIDS WITHOUT SEEING THEM\nFor each side and tick the Epoch\n  account holds a running total: every\nnew bid's C is added to it and its auditor D is added alongside.\nThe result encrypts the SUM of all sizes at that tick — one curve\naddition per bid, done by the program itself.",
      "originalText": "ADDING BIDS WITHOUT SEEING THEM\nFor each side and tick the Epoch\n  account holds a running total: every\nnew bid's C is added to it and its auditor D is added alongside.\nThe result encrypts the SUM of all sizes at that tick — one curve\naddition per bid, done by the program itself.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.acc",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cr.bsgs",
