      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DECRYPTING A TOTAL — administrator only\nWith the auditor key the administrator strips the randomness and is\nleft with (sum × G), a curve point.\n  Turning that back into the number\nis a lookup problem; baby-step giant-step (BSGS) solves it fast\nenough for sums up to the bid-count bound. The same trick lets the\noperator re-check a collateral amount, and the browser recover a\nmember's own small values.",
      "originalText": "DECRYPTING A TOTAL — administrator only\nWith the auditor key the administrator strips the randomness and is\nleft with (sum × G), a curve point.\n  Turning that back into the number\nis a lookup problem; baby-step giant-step (BSGS) solves it fast\nenough for sums up to the bid-count bound. The same trick lets the\noperator re-check a collateral amount, and the browser recover a\nmember's own small values.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.bsgs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
