    {
      "id": "cr.solv.t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4688,
      "y": 2035,
      "width": 518,
      "height": 277,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4338ca",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g.cr.solv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1117340551,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1093942916,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SOLVENCY — the one new piece of maths\nThe borrower holds E_c (hidden collateral, in shares) and E_ℓ\n  (hidden\nloan, in USDC). The public numbers are the price (in cents), the\nsplit factor, and the haircut.\nThe PROGRAM forms E_Δ = (price × factor) × E_c − haircut × E_ℓ,\n  using\nthe additive property — no one decrypts anything.\nThe borrower proves E_Δ equals a fresh commitment K, and that K is\na non-negative number (a range proof). If the pledge were too\n  small,\nΔ would be negative, which wraps to an\n  enormous number and cannot pass.\nA split changes the public factor, not the ciphertext, so it can\nneither fake nor destroy solvency.\nwindow-proofs/src/solvency.rs ·\n  scalar.rs (shared with the program)",
      "originalText": "SOLVENCY — the one new piece of maths\nThe borrower holds E_c (hidden collateral, in shares) and E_ℓ\n  (hidden\nloan, in USDC). The public numbers are the price (in cents), the\nsplit factor, and the haircut.\nThe PROGRAM forms E_Δ = (price × factor) × E_c − haircut × E_ℓ,\n  using\nthe additive property — no one decrypts anything.\nThe borrower proves E_Δ equals a fresh commitment K, and that K is\na non-negative number (a range proof). If the pledge were too\n  small,\nΔ would be negative, which wraps to an\n  enormous number and cannot pass.\nA split changes the public factor, not the ciphertext, so it can\nneither fake nor destroy solvency.\nwindow-proofs/src/solvency.rs ·\n  scalar.rs (shared with the program)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.solv",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
