      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PARTIAL FILLS\nWhen a bid is split across lenders\n  each loan gets a fresh ciphertext;\nthe borrower needs its opening to prove solvency later, so the\nadministrator seals it to the borrower with a shared secret derived\nfrom the two keys (an ECDH note) and stores it on the loan.\nwindow-elgamal/src/note.rs",
      "originalText": "PARTIAL FILLS\nWhen a bid is split across lenders\n  each loan gets a fresh ciphertext;\nthe borrower needs its opening to prove solvency later, so the\nadministrator seals it to the borrower with a shared secret derived\nfrom the two keys (an ECDH note) and stores it on the loan.\nwindow-elgamal/src/note.rs",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.note",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
