      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HOW PROOFS TRAVEL (ADR-001)\nSmall proofs ride inline, right before the instruction that needs\nthem: the PoCD, bid validity, account setup.\nBig proofs go into a context account in an earlier transaction and\nare consumed later: range proofs and the four lock proofs.\nA full print of 74 non-empty ticks\n  fits in about twenty transactions.\nwindow-proofs/src/ix.rs",
      "originalText": "HOW PROOFS TRAVEL (ADR-001)\nSmall proofs ride inline, right before the instruction that needs\nthem: the PoCD, bid validity, account setup.\nBig proofs go into a context account in an earlier transaction and\nare consumed later: range proofs and the four lock proofs.\nA full print of 74 non-empty ticks\n  fits in about twenty transactions.\nwindow-proofs/src/ix.rs",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.transport",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
