      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "crate window-elgamal\nThe curve points, ciphertexts and grouped ciphertexts; adding,\nscaling and the residual; key derivation from a wallet signature;\nBSGS decryption; the sealed notes. One implementation shared by the\nprograms (through syscalls) and the provers (on a laptop or in the\nbrowser), so both sides compute exactly the same thing.",
      "originalText": "crate window-elgamal\nThe curve points, ciphertexts and grouped ciphertexts; adding,\nscaling and the residual; key derivation from a wallet signature;\nBSGS decryption; the sealed notes. One implementation shared by the\nprograms (through syscalls) and the provers (on a laptop or in the\nbrowser), so both sides compute exactly the same thing.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.c.elgamal",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
