      "locked": false,
      "text": "crate window-clearing\nThe tick grid, the clearing rule, the pro-rata fill, the bid-count\nbound, and the stale / τ / band-edge regime. Pure, no allocation,\nso it runs unchanged inside the oracle program, the administrator\nbot, the browser verifier and the tests (with shared fixtures).",
      "originalText": "crate window-clearing\nThe tick grid, the clearing rule, the pro-rata fill, the bid-count\nbound, and the stale / τ / band-edge regime. Pure, no allocation,\nso it runs unchanged inside the oracle program, the administrator\nbot, the browser verifier and the tests (with shared fixtures).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.c.clearing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
