      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "crate window-config\nReads config/<profile>.toml — round length, tenor, limits, the\ncollateral schedule — and validates\n  it (a mock price can never hide\nbehind a real feed id). The bots, the client, the tests and the\nNode poster all read the same file.",
      "originalText": "crate window-config\nReads config/<profile>.toml — round length, tenor, limits, the\ncollateral schedule — and validates\n  it (a mock price can never hide\nbehind a real feed id). The bots, the client, the tests and the\nNode poster all read the same file.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.c.config",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
