      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "crate window-testkit\nThe tier-1 harness: loads the five programs, Token-2022 and the\nproof verifier into an in-process Solana runtime and drives whole\nrounds and loans with real proofs. One caveat it cannot catch: a\ncall to a program that is not deployed — tier 2 catches that.",
      "originalText": "crate window-testkit\nThe tier-1 harness: loads the five programs, Token-2022 and the\nproof verifier into an in-process Solana runtime and drives whole\nrounds and loans with real proofs. One caveat it cannot catch: a\ncall to a program that is not deployed — tier 2 catches that.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.c.testkit",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
