      "text": "crate window-proofs-wasm → sdk/wasm → the browser\nThe same provers and verifier compiled to WebAssembly: derive keys\nfrom a signature, build bid and lock proofs, open sealed notes,\nre-verify a print, and the confidential-transfer proofs the\ndashboard needs. Committed prebuilt, so hosting needs no Rust.",
      "originalText": "crate window-proofs-wasm → sdk/wasm → the browser\nThe same provers and verifier compiled to WebAssembly: derive keys\nfrom a signature, build bid and lock proofs, open sealed notes,\nre-verify a print, and the confidential-transfer proofs the\ndashboard needs. Committed prebuilt, so hosting needs no Rust.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cr.c.wasm",
      "autoResize": true,
