      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "③ Listing upgrade — one rate, a schedule of collaterals\nwindow_credit gained Listings (per-collateral\n  source, haircut, freshness limits), an on-chain\n\"quote too old\" rule, and a migration for the\n  loans that predated it. Covered by attack tests\nand a tier-2 lifecycle on a second listing.",
      "originalText": "③ Listing upgrade — one rate, a schedule of collaterals\nwindow_credit gained Listings (per-collateral\n  source, haircut, freshness limits), an on-chain\n\"quote too old\" rule, and a migration for the\n  loans that predated it. Covered by attack tests\nand a tier-2 lifecycle on a second listing.",
