      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "④ Pyth's own account on chain — the keeper leaves the price path\nA listing on source 4 makes lock and seize read\n  the account Pyth's receiver wrote: the price\nPyth's guardians signed, verified by Pyth's\n  program, never copied by anyone. A small Node\nposter (services/pyth-poster) forwards Hermes'\n  signed message onto devnet every minute.\nThe program side is deployed; flipping the devnet listing waits for a Pyth key.",
      "originalText": "④ Pyth's own account on chain — the keeper leaves the price path\nA listing on source 4 makes lock and seize read\n  the account Pyth's receiver wrote: the price\nPyth's guardians signed, verified by Pyth's\n  program, never copied by anyone. A small Node\nposter (services/pyth-poster) forwards Hermes'\n  signed message onto devnet every minute.\nThe program side is deployed; flipping the devnet listing waits for a Pyth key.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tr.py.s4",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tr.py.s4.badge",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1259,
      "y": 4365,
      "width": 95,
