      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1193344111,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PRESTOCKS — a pre-IPO token as collateral (hackathon track)\nPreStocks' ANTHROPIC token (a claim on private\n  Anthropic shares) is listed next to the tokenized\nstock under the SAME rate: wrap the mock twin,\n  prove collateral ≥ 200 % × loan against\nPreStocks' published mark, borrow at the print.\n  It is the only pre-IPO token on the desk,\nbecause PreStocks' rules exclude projects\n  that also integrate a competitor's tokens.\nVerified end to end on the hosted site by a fresh wallet (18–20 Sep).",
      "originalText": "PRESTOCKS — a pre-IPO token as collateral (hackathon track)\nPreStocks' ANTHROPIC token (a claim on private\n  Anthropic shares) is listed next to the tokenized\nstock under the SAME rate: wrap the mock twin,\n  prove collateral ≥ 200 % × loan against\nPreStocks' published mark, borrow at the print.\n  It is the only pre-IPO token on the desk,\nbecause PreStocks' rules exclude projects\n  that also integrate a competitor's tokens.\nVerified end to end on the hosted site by a fresh wallet (18–20 Sep).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tr.ps.h",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
