      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1757580037,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "xSTOCKS — the tokenized-stock family the desk is built for (devnet twins)\nThe \"-mock\" mints copy the real xStocks' token\n  layout — the split multiplier the solvency proof\nreads, and the issuer's clawback power (an accepted risk, true of the real thing).\n  window_wrap\nturns them into confidential twins. No real xStock,\n  pre-IPO token or PreStocks token is touched.",
      "originalText": "xSTOCKS — the tokenized-stock family the desk is built for (devnet twins)\nThe \"-mock\" mints copy the real xStocks' token\n  layout — the split multiplier the solvency proof\nreads, and the issuer's clawback power (an accepted risk, true of the real thing).\n  window_wrap\nturns them into confidential twins. No real xStock,\n  pre-IPO token or PreStocks token is touched.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tr.xs.h",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
