      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Real xStocks wrapping — the first thing after the hackathon (SPEC §23)\nPoint window_wrap at the real mainnet xStocks\n  mints; the program logic does not change, but\nreal custody and an external audit come first.\n  Later, real USDC's confidential extension\nreplaces the wrapped USDC leg.",
      "originalText": "Real xStocks wrapping — the first thing after the hackathon (SPEC §23)\nPoint window_wrap at the real mainnet xStocks\n  mints; the program logic does not change, but\nreal custody and an external audit come first.\n  Later, real USDC's confidential extension\nreplaces the wrapped USDC leg.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tr.xs.wrap",
      "autoResize": true,
