      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TESSERA — pre-IPO T-Tokens — DROPPED 21 Sep\nTessera's T-OpenAI token was listed and verified end\n  to end (17–20 Sep) with the same mechanism.\nPreStocks' rule \"projects that integrate any non-PreStocks pre-IPO tokens are\n  ineligible\" meant\nthe desk could not hold both; Tessera was removed from the config, the bots, the\n  SDK, the\ndashboard and the tracks diagram.",
      "originalText": "TESSERA — pre-IPO T-Tokens — DROPPED 21 Sep\nTessera's T-OpenAI token was listed and verified end\n  to end (17–20 Sep) with the same mechanism.\nPreStocks' rule \"projects that integrate any non-PreStocks pre-IPO tokens are\n  ineligible\" meant\nthe desk could not hold both; Tessera was removed from the config, the bots, the\n  SDK, the\ndashboard and the tracks diagram.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
