      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "METEORA DBC + CLAWPUMP — \"the lender agent\" (Part B, decided 21 Sep)\nTHE WINDOW's lender is already an autonomous agent:\n  it lends USDC every round and earns xONIA on\nstock-collateralised loans. Part B gives that agent\n  a Clawpump identity and wallet and launches\nits own token on a Meteora Dynamic Bonding Curve\n  pool on MAINNET, quoted in TSLAx and configured\nfrom the desk's own numbers. Honest framing: the\n  pool and its fees are real; the lending loop\nbehind it is the devnet desk.\nStatus: IN PROGRESS — in the working tree today (21 Sep): services/launch/src ·\n  sdk/src/dbc.ts · LenderAgent.tsx; not yet committed.",
      "originalText": "METEORA DBC + CLAWPUMP — \"the lender agent\" (Part B, decided 21 Sep)\nTHE WINDOW's lender is already an autonomous agent:\n  it lends USDC every round and earns xONIA on\nstock-collateralised loans. Part B gives that agent\n  a Clawpump identity and wallet and launches\nits own token on a Meteora Dynamic Bonding Curve\n  pool on MAINNET, quoted in TSLAx and configured\nfrom the desk's own numbers. Honest framing: the\n  pool and its fees are real; the lending loop\nbehind it is the devnet desk.\nStatus: IN PROGRESS — in the working tree today (21 Sep): services/launch/src ·\n  sdk/src/dbc.ts · LenderAgent.tsx; not yet committed.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tr.mc.h",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
