      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The code: services/launch (plan · launch · status ·\n  buy · graduate · agent) · sdk/src/dbc.ts (reads\nthe pool from the browser) · a lender-agent card\n  on the Market page · a launch-status recipe on\nthe Build page · the Meteora and Clawpump sections of docs/TRACKS.md.\nNeeds from the user: a Clawpump API key and about\n  half a SOL on mainnet for the launch wallet.\nStatus: IN PROGRESS — in the working tree today (21 Sep): services/launch/src ·\n  sdk/src/dbc.ts · LenderAgent.tsx; not yet committed.",
      "originalText": "The code: services/launch (plan · launch · status ·\n  buy · graduate · agent) · sdk/src/dbc.ts (reads\nthe pool from the browser) · a lender-agent card\n  on the Market page · a launch-status recipe on\nthe Build page · the Meteora and Clawpump sections of docs/TRACKS.md.\nNeeds from the user: a Clawpump API key and about\n  half a SOL on mainnet for the launch wallet.\nStatus: IN PROGRESS — in the working tree today (21 Sep): services/launch/src ·\n  sdk/src/dbc.ts · LenderAgent.tsx; not yet committed.",
