      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SETUP — window-admin setup\nCreates the mock stock mints and\n  their confidential twins,\ninitialises the five programs,\n  creates the escrow, adds every\nlisting from the config, admits\n  the simulated agents and\nfunds them, and writes deployments/<cluster>.json —\n  the\n\"descriptor\" every other tool and the dashboard read.\nLater: listings-sync and migrate-loans bring an\n  existing\ndeployment up to a new schedule.\n  services/admin/src/setup.rs",
      "originalText": "SETUP — window-admin setup\nCreates the mock stock mints and\n  their confidential twins,\ninitialises the five programs,\n  creates the escrow, adds every\nlisting from the config, admits\n  the simulated agents and\nfunds them, and writes deployments/<cluster>.json —\n  the\n\"descriptor\" every other tool and the dashboard read.\nLater: listings-sync and migrate-loans bring an\n  existing\ndeployment up to a new schedule.\n  services/admin/src/setup.rs",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sv.setup",
      "autoResize": true,
