      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PRICE SOURCES — one per listing (price.rs)\nPyth: Hermes with a key, else\n  the freshest of Pyth's own\non-chain accounts (owner and feed checked).\nPreStocks: the published mark\n  from its web API, stamped with\nthe fetch time (attested); the\n  last good mark is kept for a\nfew hours if the API fails.\nMock: a gentle random walk for local tests.\nSource 4: the keeper posts nothing; the program reads\n  Pyth.\nprice-check prints every listing's source, mark and\n  age.",
      "originalText": "PRICE SOURCES — one per listing (price.rs)\nPyth: Hermes with a key, else\n  the freshest of Pyth's own\non-chain accounts (owner and feed checked).\nPreStocks: the published mark\n  from its web API, stamped with\nthe fetch time (attested); the\n  last good mark is kept for a\nfew hours if the API fails.\nMock: a gentle random walk for local tests.\nSource 4: the keeper posts nothing; the program reads\n  Pyth.\nprice-check prints every listing's source, mark and\n  age.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sv.price",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
