      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE HTTP API — what the dashboard talks to\nGET /healthz · GET /metrics (counters: rounds,\n  prints, loans,\nprices, quote ages) · GET /deployment (the\n  descriptor) ·\nGET /faucet (how many joins are left this hour) ·\nPOST /join — the faucet: admits a\n  wallet, mints it shares of\nevery listed stock and sends it a little SOL, once per\nwallet, rate-limited, refused when the admin runs low.\nReached from the hosted site\n  through a temporary tunnel\n(the ?admin= link the market script prints).",
      "originalText": "THE HTTP API — what the dashboard talks to\nGET /healthz · GET /metrics (counters: rounds,\n  prints, loans,\nprices, quote ages) · GET /deployment (the\n  descriptor) ·\nGET /faucet (how many joins are left this hour) ·\nPOST /join — the faucet: admits a\n  wallet, mints it shares of\nevery listed stock and sends it a little SOL, once per\nwallet, rate-limited, refused when the admin runs low.\nReached from the hosted site\n  through a temporary tunnel\n(the ?admin= link the market script prints).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sv.http",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
