      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "COMMANDS — window-admin …\nsetup · run · agents · price-check · listings-sync ·\nmigrate-loans · listing-set-source (flip a listing to\n  Pyth's\naccount, only after reading it\n  fresh) · listing-retire (how\nTessera's listing was retired —\n  RETIRED) · zk-probe (does this\nmachine's validator accept the\n  proofs? — a known trap).",
      "originalText": "COMMANDS — window-admin …\nsetup · run · agents · price-check · listings-sync ·\nmigrate-loans · listing-set-source (flip a listing to\n  Pyth's\naccount, only after reading it\n  fresh) · listing-retire (how\nTessera's listing was retired —\n  RETIRED) · zk-probe (does this\nmachine's validator accept the\n  proofs? — a known trap).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sv.cli",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
