    {
      "id": "sv.administrator.t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3068,
      "y": 3439,
      "width": 406,
      "height": 244,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g.sv.administrator"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1752547776,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1410389025,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE ADMINISTRATOR LOOP — administrator.rs\nA closed round → decrypt the 74\n  totals (BSGS), compute r*,\nthen send: begin_print, batches\n  of attest_ticks each with\nits PoCDs inline, finalize_print with the claimed\n  rate.\nA printed round → run matching\n  and post_match per pair.\nThen the demo policy: confirm\n  funding for locked loans,\nrepay most loans half-way through their tenor, and\n  leave\nevery fourth one to default so judges see a seizure.\nNever logs a decrypted number.",
      "originalText": "THE ADMINISTRATOR LOOP — administrator.rs\nA closed round → decrypt the 74\n  totals (BSGS), compute r*,\nthen send: begin_print, batches\n  of attest_ticks each with\nits PoCDs inline, finalize_print with the claimed\n  rate.\nA printed round → run matching\n  and post_match per pair.\nThen the demo policy: confirm\n  funding for locked loans,\nrepay most loans half-way through their tenor, and\n  leave\nevery fourth one to default so judges see a seizure.\nNever logs a decrypted number.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sv.administrator",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
