      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "services/pyth-poster — Node\nOnce a minute: fetch the signed\n  price message from Hermes\n(needs the key) and hand it to\n  Pyth's receiver on devnet,\nwhich verifies it and stores the\n  price in the account that\na source-4 listing reads. Started\n  by market.sh when a key is\npresent; then the admin flips the\n  TSLAx listing to source 4.",
      "originalText": "services/pyth-poster — Node\nOnce a minute: fetch the signed\n  price message from Hermes\n(needs the key) and hand it to\n  Pyth's receiver on devnet,\nwhich verifies it and stores the\n  price in the account that\na source-4 listing reads. Started\n  by market.sh when a key is\npresent; then the admin flips the\n  TSLAx listing to source 4.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sv.poster",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
