      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "services/launch — Node (Part B)\nplan: read TSLAx/USD from Pyth, size the pool from the\nagent's capital, write the launch plan.\nlaunch: create the pool (and the\n  token) on devnet or mainnet.\nstatus · buy · graduate: watch, test-trade, migrate.\nagent: create the Clawpump agent and its wallet.\nStatus: IN PROGRESS — in the working tree today (21\n  Sep): services/launch/src · sdk/src/dbc.ts ·\n  LenderAgent.tsx; not yet committed.",
      "originalText": "services/launch — Node (Part B)\nplan: read TSLAx/USD from Pyth, size the pool from the\nagent's capital, write the launch plan.\nlaunch: create the pool (and the\n  token) on devnet or mainnet.\nstatus · buy · graduate: watch, test-trade, migrate.\nagent: create the Clawpump agent and its wallet.\nStatus: IN PROGRESS — in the working tree today (21\n  Sep): services/launch/src · sdk/src/dbc.ts ·\n  LenderAgent.tsx; not yet committed.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
