      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "verifyPrint — sdk/src/verify.ts —\n  trust nothing, check it yourself\nDownloads the round and its print,\n  finds the transactions that carried\nthe PoCDs, re-verifies every proof in\n  WebAssembly against the frozen\ntotals, recomputes r* and the matched\n  volume, and reports what matched.\nUsed by the Explorer's Re-verify button and by the tests.",
      "originalText": "verifyPrint — sdk/src/verify.ts —\n  trust nothing, check it yourself\nDownloads the round and its print,\n  finds the transactions that carried\nthe PoCDs, re-verifies every proof in\n  WebAssembly against the frozen\ntotals, recomputes r* and the matched\n  volume, and reports what matched.\nUsed by the Explorer's Re-verify button and by the tests.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd.sdk.verify",
