      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#/home — the front door\nThe window clock (where the current round is), the latest xONIA and\nrecent prints, each listed stock with\n  its mark and whether the chain\nwould accept it right now, a borrow calculator, and \"Try it\", which\nmakes a burner wallet and sends you to the Desk.",
      "originalText": "#/home — the front door\nThe window clock (where the current round is), the latest xONIA and\nrecent prints, each listed stock with\n  its mark and whether the chain\nwould accept it right now, a borrow calculator, and \"Try it\", which\nmakes a burner wallet and sends you to the Desk.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd.app.home",
      "autoResize": true,
