      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#/desk — the judge path, five\n  guided steps (about 20 seconds)\n① Derive your keys (two signatures)\n  · ② Join the desk (the faucet)\n③ Set up your confidential account ·\n  ④ Wrap shares · ⑤ Seal a bid.\nAutopilot runs all five, waits for an open round and bids slightly\npast the last print so it clears.\n  Works with a burner or any wallet.\nDesk.tsx · useDesk.ts",
      "originalText": "#/desk — the judge path, five\n  guided steps (about 20 seconds)\n① Derive your keys (two signatures)\n  · ② Join the desk (the faucet)\n③ Set up your confidential account ·\n  ④ Wrap shares · ⑤ Seal a bid.\nAutopilot runs all five, waits for an open round and bids slightly\npast the last print so it clears.\n  Works with a burner or any wallet.\nDesk.tsx · useDesk.ts",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd.app.desk",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
