      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#/positions — your loans\nEach loan with its lifecycle track;\n  Lock (the proofs are built here,\nfrom the bid's saved opening or the sealed note) and Deposit into\nthat loan's escrow; a button to open an account on another listing\nso a default can pay you. Reads the chain only.",
      "originalText": "#/positions — your loans\nEach loan with its lifecycle track;\n  Lock (the proofs are built here,\nfrom the bid's saved opening or the sealed note) and Deposit into\nthat loan's escrow; a button to open an account on another listing\nso a default can pay you. Reads the chain only.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd.app.positions",
      "autoResize": true,
