      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Console · live events · burner · session\nA developer console (backtick key) logs every SDK call as copyable\ncode and every transaction — never a signature or a bid opening.\nA WebSocket layer follows all five programs and decodes their\nevents. The burner is a throwaway wallet kept in the browser; the\nsession keeps your derived keys in memory only.\nwindow.thewindow exposes the SDK and client in DevTools.",
      "originalText": "Console · live events · burner · session\nA developer console (backtick key) logs every SDK call as copyable\ncode and every transaction — never a signature or a bid opening.\nA WebSocket layer follows all five programs and decodes their\nevents. The burner is a throwaway wallet kept in the browser; the\nsession keeps your derived keys in memory only.\nwindow.thewindow exposes the SDK and client in DevTools.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sd.app.console",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
