      "text": "TIER 1 — tests/ on LiteSVM\nSolana's real runtime and real\n  proof verifier, run inside the\ntest process with the five compiled programs: fast,\n  exact,\nand every proof is real. cargo test --workspace.\nSuites: e2e · attacks · invariants · privacy ·\n  measurements\n— all green at HEAD.",
      "originalText": "TIER 1 — tests/ on LiteSVM\nSolana's real runtime and real\n  proof verifier, run inside the\ntest process with the five compiled programs: fast,\n  exact,\nand every proof is real. cargo test --workspace.\nSuites: e2e · attacks · invariants · privacy ·\n  measurements\n— all green at HEAD.",
