      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "e2e — the happy paths\nA full round with five members,\n  bids → print → re-verify.\nA full loan: wrap → bid → print\n  → match → lock → deposit →\nconfirm → fund → repay → release → unwrap; the\n  default and\nseize path; a second listing; a legacy-loan migration.",
      "originalText": "e2e — the happy paths\nA full round with five members,\n  bids → print → re-verify.\nA full loan: wrap → bid → print\n  → match → lock → deposit →\nconfirm → fund → repay → release → unwrap; the\n  default and\nseize path; a second listing; a legacy-loan migration.",
      "fontSize": 13,
