      "text": "measurements — the numbers in the README\nThe original go / no-go gate (a\n  decrypted sum with a true\nproof passes, a false one fails),\n  and the cost of a print at\n1, 10, 37 and 74 non-empty\n  ticks, kept in sync with the\nREADME by a CI check.",
