      "text": "TIER 2 — tests/integration on a real validator\nA local solana-test-validator\n  with the real bots and the\ndashboard's own code path,\n  driven through the TypeScript\nSDK: the thing tier 1 cannot see\n  (a missing program, a real\nnetwork) shows up here. make test-integration.",
