      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CI — .github/workflows\nci.yml: format and lint · build\n  the programs and run tier 1 ·\nbuild the SDK and app, run the\n  unit tests, check the generated\ndocs (measurements, this diagram) · tier 2 · doc\n  rules\n(honest claims, lineage). tier2.yml: on demand, with a\nvalidator built from source (the\n  prebuilt Linux one rejects\nvalid proofs — a documented\n  trap). pages.yml: publishes the\ndashboard on every push to main.",
      "originalText": "CI — .github/workflows\nci.yml: format and lint · build\n  the programs and run tier 1 ·\nbuild the SDK and app, run the\n  unit tests, check the generated\ndocs (measurements, this diagram) · tier 2 · doc\n  rules\n(honest claims, lineage). tier2.yml: on demand, with a\nvalidator built from source (the\n  prebuilt Linux one rejects\nvalid proofs — a documented\n  trap). pages.yml: publishes the\ndashboard on every push to main.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ts.ci",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
