      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Makefile · package.json — the entry points\nmake build · test · test-integration · demo (one\n  full round\non a laptop, then re-verified) ·\n  deploy-devnet · freeze ·\nsize (the programs' rent budget).\npnpm build · test · codegen ·\n  docs:diagrams · watch:epoch ·\nschedule · leak-audit.",
      "originalText": "Makefile · package.json — the entry points\nmake build · test · test-integration · demo (one\n  full round\non a laptop, then re-verified) ·\n  deploy-devnet · freeze ·\nsize (the programs' rent budget).\npnpm build · test · codegen ·\n  docs:diagrams · watch:epoch ·\nschedule · leak-audit.",
