      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROFILES — config/*.toml, frozen\n  into the programs at setup\ndemo (fast rounds on a laptop) ·\n  integration (very fast, for\ntier 2) · devnet (≈ 7-minute\n  rounds, ≈ 3-round loans) · prod\n(hour-long rounds, six-hour loans).\nEach sets the round length,\n  grace, print deadline, price\nfreshness, the haircut, the\n  proof batch size — and the\ncollateral schedule ([[listings]]).",
      "originalText": "PROFILES — config/*.toml, frozen\n  into the programs at setup\ndemo (fast rounds on a laptop) ·\n  integration (very fast, for\ntier 2) · devnet (≈ 7-minute\n  rounds, ≈ 3-round loans) · prod\n(hour-long rounds, six-hour loans).\nEach sets the round length,\n  grace, print deadline, price\nfreshness, the haircut, the\n  proof batch size — and the\ncollateral schedule ([[listings]]).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ts.profiles",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
