      "text": "scripts/ — the small tools\ncheck_claims (the §14 rule, also over this file) ·\ncheck_lineage · sync_idl · build_wasm · leak_audit\n  (attack a\nlive cluster's history for secrets) · watch_epoch\n  (wait for\nprints and re-verify them) · schedule (the collateral\nschedule with verdicts) · measurements_to_md ·\ntracks_diagram and project_diagram (this map).",
      "originalText": "scripts/ — the small tools\ncheck_claims (the §14 rule, also over this file) ·\ncheck_lineage · sync_idl · build_wasm · leak_audit\n  (attack a\nlive cluster's history for secrets) · watch_epoch\n  (wait for\nprints and re-verify them) · schedule (the collateral\nschedule with verdicts) · measurements_to_md ·\ntracks_diagram and project_diagram (this map).",
