      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Margin calls inside the tenor\nA top-up instruction using the same solvency proof, partial\nseizure, and haircuts calibrated per stock from recorded\nvolatility. Today: a fixed haircut and a deadline.",
